{"metadata":{"slug":[{"Plain":"切微丛"},0],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"title":[{"Plain":"切微丛"},2],"taxon":[{"Plain":"百科. "},3],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>观念</h2>\n<p>拓扑流形的切微丛是一个"},{"Local":{"url":"微丛","text":"微丛"}},{"Plain":", 是光滑流形的"},{"Local":{"url":"切丛","text":"切丛"}},{"Plain":"的一种模拟.</p>\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>拓扑流形 $M$ 的切微丛是 $M$ 上的"},{"Local":{"url":"微丛","text":"微丛"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathrm{pr}_1 \\colon M\\times M \\to M$.</p>\n"}]}}